# Build context filter for the static FFmpeg recipe. BuildKit reads it instead of a
# .dockerignore because it sits next to the Dockerfile with a matching name.
#
# Allow list: the context is the recipe itself, and all of it goes into the source archive, so
# local build output or editor files must never enter it.
*
!Dockerfile
!Dockerfile.dockerignore
!README.md
!sources.list
!scripts/*.sh
!verify/*.c
!verify/*.sh
!verify/*.txt
!verify/Dockerfile
